---
---

<dialog
  id="dialog-strategy"
  class="fixed inset-0 z-50 p-3 sm:p-4 m-auto bg-transparent backdrop:bg-black/85 max-w-xl w-[calc(100vw-1.5rem)]"
  aria-labelledby="strategy-dialog-title"
>
  <div class="poki-card rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 border-2 border-purple-500/40 text-slate-100 flex flex-col gap-4 max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto shadow-2xl">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700/60 pb-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-2xl bg-purple-500/20 border border-purple-400/50 flex items-center justify-center text-base shadow-sm">
          ⚡
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-300 uppercase tracking-wider block font-['Outfit']">TACTICAL PLAYBOOK</span>
          <h2 id="strategy-dialog-title" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-white tracking-wide font-['Outfit']">
            Grandmaster Strategies & Pro Tips
          </h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button
        id="btn-close-strategy"
        type="button"
        class="p-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        aria-label="Close strategy guide dialog"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Strategy Cards -->
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-200">
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium">
        Mastering hexagonal geometry requires spatial awareness and balancing territory growth (cloning) against aggressive leaps (jumping).
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-200">
        
        <!-- Tip 1: Edge & Corner Anchoring -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b1021] border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold">DEFENSE</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Edge & Corner Anchoring</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Hexes on outer perimeters have only 3 to 4 neighbors compared to 6 in the interior. Anchoring along edges prevents opponents from surrounding your gems.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tip 2: The Jump Trap -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b1021] border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold">CAUTION</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Beware the Reckless Jump</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Leaping into open territory leaves an isolated piece exposed to counter-attacks. Prefer cloning unless a jump gives a massive 3+ piece conversion swing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tip 3: Denial & Bottleneck Control -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b1021] border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 border border-rose-500/40 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold">CONTROL</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Choke Points & Bridges</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            In maps like Donut Void or Hourglass, controlling narrow bridges cuts off opponent expansion, forcing them to leap blindly into your traps.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tip 4: Late Game Sweep -->
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b1021] border border-slate-700/80 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold">ENDGAME</span>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">Chain Conversions</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            When the board is nearly full, single moves can convert up to 6 adjacent hexes at once. Calculate ahead to ensure your moves cannot be counter-captured.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Action -->
    <div class="flex justify-end pt-2 border-t border-slate-700/60">
      <button
        id="btn-confirm-strategy"
        type="button"
        class="poki-btn poki-btn-primary px-6 py-2.5 rounded-2xl text-xs font-black font-mono uppercase"
      >
        GOT IT!
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</dialog>
